      "channelId": "channel.group.lunch-chat",
      "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
      "time": "11:57",
      "visibleFrom": "day.06",
      "unlock": [],
      "lines": [
        "所以是找到了？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg.day6.box-system",
      "channelId": "channel.group.lunch-chat",
      "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
      "time": "11:58",
      "visibleFrom": "day.06",
      "unlock": [],
      "lines": [
        "還沒找到。昨天收到的是電子回條，不是那張紙本移交單。"
      ],
      "replyPrompt": {
        "id": "prompt.day6.closed-box",
        "availableThrough": "day.06",
        "choices": [
          {
            "id": "not-found",
            "text": "那不算找到吧。",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day6.reply.not-found-yang",
                "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
                "time": "11:59",
                "lines": [
                  "嗯，我把待補那欄留著。下午再問一次。"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "msg.day6.reply.not-found-wu",
                "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
                "time": "12:00",
                "lines": [
                  "問到放哪裡就好，別又只給我一張回條。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "no-more-calls",
            "text": "至少不會再有人來問。",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day6.reply.calls-wu",
                "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
                "time": "11:59",
                "lines": [
                  "早上已經有人問了，我還是得找。"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "msg.day6.reply.calls-yang",
                "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
                "time": "12:00",
                "lines": [
                  "我跟窗口說一聲，先別把這件結掉。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "id": "ask-closer",
            "text": "誰把單關掉的？",
            "responses": [
              {
                "id": "msg.day6.reply.closer-yang",
                "actorId": "actor.yang-zi-qian",
                "time": "11:59",
                "lines": [
                  "回條是窗口帳號發的。我還在問誰接到箱子。"
                ]
              },
              {
                "id": "msg.day6.reply.closer-wu",
                "actorId": "actor.wu-wan-ting",
                "time": "12:00",
                "lines": [
                  "要是問到，你幫我留名字。我不想下週再找一次。"
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
